<html>=0A=
<body bgcolor=3D"#ffffff" text=3D"#000000">=0A=
<img src=3D"cid:C5CFCE6E.188D2234">=0A=
<br>=0A=
The beggar is the only person in the universe not obliged to study appearan=
ce.=0A=
<br>=0A=
Know, first, who you are, and then adorn yourself accordingly.=0A=
<br>=0A=
I have a rendezvous with Death at some disputed barricade.=0A=
<br>=0A=
It's better to get mugged than to live a life of fear.=0A=
<br>=0A=
There just isn't any pleasing some people. The trick is to stop trying.=0A=
<br>=0A=
Many miles away there's a shadow on the door of a cottage on the Shore of a=
 dark Scottish lake.=0A=
<br>=0A=
The people to fear are not those who disagree with you, but those who disag=
ree with you and are too cowardly to let you know.=0A=
<br>=0A=
Oh, duty is what one expects from others, it is not what one does oneself.=
=0A=
<br>=0A=
The present condition of fame is merely fashion.=0A=
<br>=0A=
Look for the good, not the evil, in the conduct of members of the family.=
=0A=
<br>=0A=
The weeping of an heir is laughter in disguise.=0A=
<br>=0A=
I have lived, and I have run the course which fortune allotted me and now m=
y shade shall descend illustrious to the grave.=0A=
<br>=0A=
Most people are willing to pay more to be amused than to be educated.=0A=
</body>=0A=
</html>=0A=
=0A=

